  m_text: '> STATUS: CLASSIFIED

    > ERA: THE MODERN ERA (2010s / 2020s)

    > FIRST APPEARANCE: RESIDENT EVIL 7: BIOHAZARD (2017)

    > CURRENT AFFILIATION: NONE (CIVILIAN EACHMAN)


    [OPERATIONAL DATA LOG]

